Create a new Flutter application.
Import the Material Design package.
Define the main() function and call runApp().
Create a class named MyApp using StatelessWidget.
Use MaterialApp and Scaffold to create the application screen.
Add an AppBar with the title Patient Dashboard.
Use Column to arrange the widgets vertically.
Use Container to display patient details such as name, ID and age.
Use Row to display three icons horizontally.
Use Card and ListTile to display doctor and room information.
Run the application and verify the output.
